{"id":1800618,"retrievedAt":"2026-10-18T14:42:23.058Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1800618,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["CO"],"original_language":"es","original_title":"Piso 19","overview":"For three years, the director has been capturing the ever-changing face of Bogotá from the windows of her 19th-floor flat. The time-lapse footage alternates between day and night, depicting everything from minor street scenes to major events – fireworks, a fire, demonstrations and riots. Their political context is occasionally complemented by the sound of television news reports. Gradually, however, the filmmaker’s private life also becomes interwoven with her observations of the city: we hear conversations with her partner and read their messages to one another, ranging from everyday questions about what’s for dinner to tense moments in their relationship.","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"CO","name":"Colombia"}],"release_date":"2026-10-26","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Spanish","iso_639_1":"es","name":"Español"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"19th Floor","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":2572094,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Patricia Ayala Ruiz","original_name":"Patricia Ayala Ruiz","popularity":0.4784,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6ad463202178de8de6b40fdf","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6557287,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"Octavio Céspedes","original_name":"Octavio Céspedes","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6ad4633cdda0be39240d8aa1","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":2572094,"known_for_department":"D